-aa8b4aeb4d9f83ad0fdd090be989efd134db9b9b Add gyro-twin: white-noise gyro twin hides the bias random walk; heading variance ratio exactly 1+(t/t*)^2, re-alignment interval 24x too long, single-point Allan fit right at one horizon only, dead-reckoning range over-stated 1.25-1.74x (companion to odometry-twin and rendezvous-twin)
-1cb1e15b13b0169423ada47e57645186fe1ddaae Merge pull request #223 from Duncan-Haywood/claude/happy-wright-9x28x7
-ae07bb9d2f920413535f010d41deb1f48a26df48 Add blur-twin: instantaneous-exposure twin of a finite-exposure camera certifies detection at every speed; moving bar is an exact trapezoid, twin-tuned peak detector has speed limit wC/(sigma z), blur-matched box filter raises it quadratically (companion to shutter-twin and doppler-twin)
-b3c2aa387bb0b685aa5e118e91522403c4a3eed9 Add roundtrip-twin: zero-wind twin of a UAV out-and-back leg; wind does not cancel (real/twin energy 1/(1-(w/v)^2)), twin-optimal airspeed too slow, one-leg-calibrated twin off by exactly +-w/v with the sign of the leg flown (companion to uav-energy-twin and drag-twin)
-e52afd7d987b36bdea55432a6fe277ea5174837a Add thermal-twin: a constant-gain twin of a motor holding a load certifies every load; magnet derating gives a fold at lambda=4/27, no hold above it, finite runaway time, short tests cannot see it, refitting a constant gain does not remove it (companion to windup-twin and gravity-twin)
