-5ec9b47cf95c3ba66302c4f6e76c2a0b45a47616 Add warmstart-twin: cold-start bias of short twin runs, exact AR(1) bias/variance/warm-up deletion, M/M/1 empty-start bias constant rho/(1-rho)^3, negligible at valid-interval lengths but large at 50 jobs, MSER-5 did not help
